# Text files are stored and checked out with LF, on every platform.
#
# This repository is edited from Windows and from Linux containers. With the policy left
# to each machine's core.autocrlf, the working tree came to differ from every blob in the
# history without a single content change, which hides real diffs and would put whole-file
# end-of-line churn into unrelated commits. Binary files are still detected by text=auto
# and are never converted.
* text=auto eol=lf
